 did not matter."],"question":"Using this lesson idea — Creating a healthy food advertisement can persuade positively with honest claims, real food photos/drawings… — which choice is best?","type":"multiple_choice"},{"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Respect and accuracy mean checking evidence and honouring limits/protocols.","options":["Invent missing details to make the answer sound complete.","Ignore safety or cultural protocols to finish faster.","Treat every online claim as equally reliable.","Check facts/cues, acknowledge limits, and avoid inventing details."],"question":"Which action shows respect and accuracy together?","type":"multiple_choice"},{"correct_index":1,"explanation":"Independence requires a new example that still uses the skill.","options":["Ads that mock bodies are not healthy messaging.","Create one honest food ad (poster/script). Peer-check for honesty and kindness.","Retype the worked example with no new example.","Copy the example and call that independent work."],"question":"Which task best shows independent use of advertise?","type":"multiple_choice"},{"explanation":"Independent evidence on new material demonstrates the skill; copying the model does not.","marking_guide":"Require independently produced work with a specific supporting detail.","question":"Produce a fresh example demonstrating advertise on new material (not the worked model). Explain the particular words, sources or choices that make it work.","sample_answer":"Original response on new material: Any rewrite without body insults and with a fair claim. Reasoning: I used advertise by attending to honest rather than copying the worked model.","type":"short_answer"},{"explanation":"A useful correction changes the inaccurate idea or method and explains why.","marking_guide":"Require misconception + correction + purpose-linked reason.","question":"Name one likely error with advertise, correct it, and explain why the correction helps a reader or audience.","sample_answer":"Common erro