easoned change is more useful than a longer answer.","icon":"📖","notice":"Writing only a final label without a reason does not show PDHPE thinking. Change the choice or strategy, not just the wording.","title":"Show the reasoning","visual":[{"alt":"Honest ad.","caption":"Kind check.","svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 660 150\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"12\" width=\"310\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#fff4ea\" stroke=\"#b87445\"/><rect x=\"340\" y=\"12\" width=\"310\" height=\"126\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#e8f5ed\" stroke=\"#297a61\"/><g font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#263948\"><text x=\"28\" y=\"42\">Poster/script</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"78\">peer check</text><text x=\"358\" y=\"42\">Risk</text><text x=\"358\" y=\"78\">body mockery</text></g></svg>"}]},{"check":{"correct_index":1,"explanation":"Use an intentionally unsafe or unhelpful choice as a comparison. Name the specific PDHPE error, then show the safer or more respectful choice. Supported choices follow the actual cues, rules and purpose of the task.","options":["A guess with no reason.","Use an intentionally unsafe or unhelpful choice as a comparison. Name the specific PDHPE error, then show the safer or more respectful choice.","A choice unrelated to safety, health or respect.","An answer copied without understanding."],"question":"Which choice best shows accurate use of this idea about advertise?","type":"multiple_choice"},"example":"WORKED MODEL\nAds that mock bodies are not healthy messaging. Here is a more helpful example: Example student ad: crunchy apple + “fibre for play” with a truthful note.\n\nTRY FIRST\nDescribe why the warned-against choice does not work, then write a safer, kinder or healthier choice with a reason.\n\nFEEDBACK\nAny rewrite without body insults and with a fair claim.","explain":"Use an intentionally unsafe or unhelpful choice as a comparison. Name the specific PDHPE error, then show the safer or more respectful choice.\n\nWHY IT MATTERS\nThis helps the learner make s